---
layout: base.njk
description: Practical, field-tested farming guides and a free farm profit calculator for African farmers.
---
<div class="hero"><div class="wrap"><h1>Farm smarter. Know your numbers before you plant.</h1><p>Step-by-step farming ebooks, honest articles, and a free calculator that shows your costs and expected profit.</p><a class="btn" href="/ebooks/">Browse ebooks</a><a class="btn alt" href="/calculator/">Try the calculator</a></div></div>
<section><div class="wrap"><h2>Ebooks</h2><div class="grid">{% for e in collections.ebooks %}<a class="card" href="{{ e.url }}" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit">{% if e.data.cover %}<img class="cover" src="{{ e.data.cover }}" alt="">{% else %}<div class="cover">{{ e.data.title }}</div>{% endif %}<div class="b"><h3>{{ e.data.title }}</h3><span class="price">&#8358;{{ e.data.price }}</span></div></a>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>
<section><div class="wrap"><h2>Latest articles</h2>{% if collections.posts.length %}<div class="grid">{% for p in collections.posts | limit(6) %}<a class="card" href="{{ p.url }}" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit"><div class="b"><h3>{{ p.data.title }}</h3><span class="muted">{{ p.data.category }}</span><p>{{ p.data.description }}</p></div></a>{% endfor %}</div>{% else %}<p>Articles are on the way. Check back soon.</p>{% endif %}</div></section>
{% if site.newsletterAction %}<section><div class="wrap"><div class="cta"><h2>Get farming tips by email</h2><form action="{{ site.newsletterAction }}" method="post"><input type="email" name="email" required placeholder="Your email" style="padding:12px;font:inherit"> <button class="btn" type="submit">Subscribe</button></form></div></div></section>{% endif %}
